   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Labels (WSO2 template):  [C-High] highly confidential.  Arrows 1, 3 (to the sign-in) and 5 are\nnetwork calls [M-NT]; the 3 join, the token hand-over and 2 and 4 are inside the pod.\n[B-EX-CP] WSO2 part outside Agentic Engineer.  [B-EX-EN] outside entity.",
